      "patch": "@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@ jobs:\n               - \"test/**/!(*.md)\"\n               - \"python/sglang/kernels/aot/**/*.!(md|txt)\"\n               - \".github/workflows/pr-test-arm64.yml\"\n+              - \".github/workflows/release-docker-arm64.yml\"\n               - \"docker/arm64.Dockerfile\"\n \n   pr-gate:",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/511415587d4afab03bc03c97440fba1bec7b8fa7/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fpr-test-arm64.yml",
      "sha": "d44911121f290ccf5a6933c9c4b180e8917edb35",
